  m_ExampleName: Large Pyramid
  m_Category: Benchmarks
  m_Purpose: "A pyramid of rounded boxes, as many rows high as it is wide along the base.\nIt shows how well a tall stack of resting bodies holds its shape."
  m_Controls: "Base Count: how many boxes wide the base is. The pyramid is restacked when it changes.\nGravity Scale: how hard gravity leans on the stack. It acts on the stack where it stands."
  m_Description: A large pyramid of boxes stress-testing stacking stability.
